            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Ga Han Quoc Dagiya",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary21075 contributions\n1\nLunch time\nNov 2022 • Solo\nHungry stomach, looking for heathy and easy lunch 🥗 in Indochina shopping mall . Finally decided for bibimbap. It was colder one not as I am used to have with hot stony pot but compromise is needed. Sitting outside in cooler autumn 🍂 air is better than air conditioning inside. Waiting a bit but leaving full.\nWritten November 5, 2022",
